                <span class="emoji">✨</span>
                <h2>The Future Is Vintage — Powered by AI</h2>
            </div>

            <p>Vintage fashion is timeless — and with AI, vintage influencers can make that timelessness visible, shoppable, and shareable in ways never before possible.</p>

